ariant=\"bold\">R</mi></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">X</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">β</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">R</mi></mrow><msup><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">R</mi></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">⊤</mi></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></mrow><mi>n</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">X</mi></mrow><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">β</mi><mo>,</mo><msup><mi>σ</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">I</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span>\nby <span class=\"citation\" data-cites=\"thm-mvn-linear\">@thm-mvn-linear</span>, so <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{R}\\mathbf{Y}\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D411 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx-c1D418 TEX-B\"></mjx-c></mjx-mi></mjx-TeXAtom></mjx-math><mjx-assistive-mml unselectable=\"on\" display=\"inline\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">R</mi></mrow><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mi mathvariant=\"bold\">Y</mi></mrow></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></span> has the same distribution as <span class=\"math inline\"><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"CHTML\" style=\"font-size: 113.1%; position: relative;\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf{Y}\"><mjx-math class=\" MJX-TEX\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><mjx-TeXAtom texclass=\"ORD\"><mjx-mi class=\"mjx-b\"><mjx-c class=\"mjx